#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "A free IBM course on quantum information and computation"
msgstr "Kursus IBM percuma mengenai maklumat dan pengiraan kuantum"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: sidebar_label
#, no-wrap
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "Pengenalan"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In the following video, John Watrous steps you through the content in this "
"lesson on single systems. Alternatively, you can open the [YouTube "
"video](https://youtu.be/3-c4xJa7Flk?list=PLOFEBzvs-VvqKKMXX4vbi4EB1uaErFMSO)"
" for this lesson in a separate window. [Download the "
"slides](https://ibm.box.com/public/static/95va6f5vqru3mpsv9p5ivwcyxino4rk7.pdf)"
" for this lesson.\n"
msgstr ""
"Dalam video berikut, John Watrous membimbing anda melalui kandungan "
"pelajaran mengenai sistem tunggal ini. Sebagai alternatif, anda boleh "
"membuka [video YouTube](https://youtu.be/3-c4xJa7Flk?list=PLOFEBzvs-"
"VvqKKMXX4vbi4EB1uaErFMSO) untuk pelajaran ini dalam tetingkap berasingan. "
"[Muat turun "
"slaid](https://ibm.box.com/public/static/95va6f5vqru3mpsv9p5ivwcyxino4rk7.pdf)"
" untuk pelajaran ini.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<IBMVideo id=\"134056207\" title=\"In this video, John Watrous describes "
"classical and quantum state vectors. He introduces some critical notation "
"for quantum states and operators, including unitary matrices for operations "
"on qubit systems.\"/>\n"
msgstr ""
"<IBMVideo id=\"134056207\" title=\"Dalam video ini, John Watrous menerangkan"
" vektor keadaan klasik dan kuantum. Beliau memperkenalkan beberapa notasi "
"penting untuk keadaan kuantum dan pengoperasi, termasuk matriks unitari "
"untuk operasi pada sistem qubit.\"/>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This lesson introduces the basic framework of <DefinitionTooltip "
"definition=\"Quantum information is both a concept and a framework for "
"modeling and describing information in quantum systems. While it is based on"
" and motivated by quantum physics, the physical details can largely be "
"abstracted away, leaving a mathematical framework that is applicable to a "
"variety of specific physical systems.\">quantum "
"information</DefinitionTooltip>, including the description of quantum states"
" as vectors with complex number entries, measurements that allow classical "
"information to be extracted from quantum states, and operations on quantum "
"states that are described by unitary matrices.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pelajaran ini memperkenalkan rangka kerja asas <DefinitionTooltip "
"definition=\"Maklumat kuantum adalah satu konsep dan juga rangka kerja untuk"
" memodelkan dan menerangkan maklumat dalam sistem kuantum. Walaupun ia "
"berdasarkan dan didorong oleh fizik kuantum, butiran fizikal sebahagian "
"besarnya boleh diabstraksikan, meninggalkan rangka kerja matematik yang "
"boleh digunakan untuk pelbagai sistem fizikal tertentu.\">maklumat "
"kuantum</DefinitionTooltip>, termasuk penerangan keadaan kuantum sebagai "
"vektor dengan entri nombor kompleks, pengukuran yang membolehkan maklumat "
"klasik diekstrak daripada keadaan kuantum, dan operasi pada keadaan kuantum "
"yang diterangkan oleh matriks unitari.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We will restrict our attention in this lesson to the comparatively simple setting in which a *single system* is considered in isolation.\n"
"In the next lesson, we'll expand our view to *multiple systems,* which can interact with one another and be correlated.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kita akan mengehadkan perhatian dalam pelajaran ini kepada tetapan yang agak mudah di mana *sistem tunggal* dipertimbangkan secara berasingan.\n"
"Dalam pelajaran seterusnya, kita akan meluaskan pandangan kepada *pelbagai sistem,* yang boleh berinteraksi antara satu sama lain dan saling berkait.\n"
